      "sender": "Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **From:** Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 62
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L3",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 08:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 63,
      "end": 123
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L5",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 08:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Maintenance request NBL-021: shower and hot water are not working. Tenant says they checked the switch and the boiler has no power. No boiler make or model supplied; small birds are kept at the property.",
      "start": 125,
      "end": 328
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L1",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 08:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L2",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 08:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L3",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 08:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L5",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 08:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Acknowledged the maintenance report and said the landlord would be contacted before next steps were confirmed. Invited the tenant to provide any further relevant details.",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 294
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L1",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L2",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L3",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 121
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L5",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Tenant said there was no hot water at the taps as well as in the shower, and that the boiler had no power despite checking the switch. A household member could be at home, but the tenant asked to be contacted about arrangements; the household member does not speak English. Tenant asked if it could be addressed that day before work.",
      "start": 123,
      "end": 456
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L1",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L2",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L3",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 121
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Maya said the loss of hot water would be treated as urgent and that she would contact the landlord about attendance. She said the tenant would not be charged for the reported fault, while also noting that a call-out might be chargeable if an inspection found only a switch left off. No inspection or diagnosis has taken place.",
      "start": 123,
      "end": 449
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:17:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:17:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:17:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Tessa Moor (Duty Operations Lead, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 148
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:17:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "The file was categorised as Electrical based on the tenant's report of no boiler power. The approval workflow was initiated. No inspection, diagnosis, or contractor attendance is recorded.",
      "start": 150,
      "end": 338
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L2",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L3",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Ravi Sethi (Landlord, property owner)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 131
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L5",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Reported the loss of hot water and the tenant's statement that the boiler has no power. Asked Ravi to confirm whether he would arrange attendance himself or wanted Northbridge Lettings to arrange a contractor.",
      "start": 133,
      "end": 342
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L1",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:34:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Update",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L2",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:34:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L3",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:34:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **To:** Tessa Moor (Duty Operations Lead, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L5",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:34:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "The file was moved to a landlord-managed repair route, and the approval follow-up was stopped. No contractor appointment was booked by Northbridge Lettings.",
      "start": 152,
      "end": 308
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L1",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L2",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L3",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L5",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Advised that the landlord would arrange the work directly and that the tenant or household might be contacted about access. Asked the tenant to report if nobody made contact or attended.",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 310
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L1",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:36:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L2",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:36:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L3",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:36:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Ravi Sethi (Landlord, property owner)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 131
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L5",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:36:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Confirmed the landlord-managed route and asked Ravi to advise when the work was expected to be completed. Said Northbridge Lettings could arrange a contractor instead if he preferred.",
      "start": 133,
      "end": 316
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L1",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L2",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L3",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Ravi Sethi (Landlord, property owner)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L5",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-06 09:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Ravi said he would ask one of his own contractors to attend that day. He also asked for a building contact to message the tenant about arrangements. No contractor name or appointment time was given.",
      "start": 132,
      "end": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L1",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L2",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L3",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L5",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Asked whether the landlord-arranged work had been completed. Asked the tenant to say if nothing had been done or nobody had made contact.",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 261
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L1",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L2",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L3",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 62,
      "end": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L5",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Tenant replied: “Nothing done about it thanks.” No restoration of hot water or boiler power was reported.",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 229
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L1",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:30:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L2",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:30:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L3",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:30:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Ravi Sethi (Landlord, property owner)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 131
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L5",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:30:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Reported that the tenant said there was still no hot water and no repair had taken place. Requested an update on the contractor's timing and said Northbridge Lettings could arrange a contractor if the landlord wanted to change course.",
      "start": 133,
      "end": 367
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L1",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L2",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L3",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Ravi Sethi (Landlord, property owner)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L5",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-11 10:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Maya left a voicemail following up on the tenant's report of no hot water and no work completed, and asked Ravi to respond. No conversation or response was recorded.",
      "start": 132,
      "end": 297
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L1",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 16:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L2",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 16:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L3",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 16:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Ravi Sethi (Landlord, property owner)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L5",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 16:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Ravi said he believed his plumber would attend that evening. He said Northbridge Lettings could send its own contractor the following day if the plumber did not attend. No agency contractor was booked during the call.",
      "start": 132,
      "end": 349
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L1",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 09:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L2",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 09:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L3",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 09:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Ravi Sethi (Landlord, property owner)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 131
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L5",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 09:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Asked whether the plumber had attended as expected and what the outcome was. The email noted the continuing report of no hot water and asked Ravi to say if Northbridge Lettings should arrange a contractor.",
      "start": 133,
      "end": 338
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L1",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 09:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L2",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 09:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L3",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 09:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Iris Vale (Tenant, resident)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 121
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L5",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 09:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Tenant said there was still no hot water and nobody had come to fix it. Tenant separately reported that the letterbox was not working and asked whether it needed to be reported separately. Maya said she would follow up; no further details or assessment of the letterbox issue were recorded.",
      "start": 123,
      "end": 413
    },
    {
      "id": "018:L1",
      "event_id": "018",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-15 08:37:00 UTC",
